Description: Update chrome_browser_browser.patch for Debian Chromium 144.0.7559.96
 Adjusts line numbers and git index hashes to match Debian's patched Chromium
 source. Debian applies additional patches (in Step 5.5 of debian/rules) that
 shift line numbers compared to vanilla Chromium. This patch ensures the CEF
 browser integration patch applies cleanly to Debian Chromium. Includes fix for
 WindowFeature parameter type cast.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-01-24

